  "title": "The Rapture Protocol",
  "subtitle": "\"Three billion people vanished. The rest of us were told to fight for the right to follow them. I was a high-school chemistry teacher. I refused.\"",
  "penName": "Adele Frye",
  "genre": "apocalypseZombie",
  "hook": "On a Tuesday in October three billion people vanished from Earth in a single instant. Those of us who remained received a notification. The notification said we had been found \"unworthy\" and could, if we chose to complete certain tasks, earn the right to follow the ones we loved. The tasks were brutal. I was a thirty-four-year-old chemistry teacher in Albuquerque. My husband Amir had vanished. My sister had vanished. My best friend had vanished. The first task the System gave me was to kill my neighbor. I refused. The System marked me.",
